  "body": "As pointed out by @jonco3 in IRC, the current fetching logic will\nrecurse infinitely if a module imports itself (directly or indirectly).\nThis fixes that by keeping track of all ancestors being fetched and not\nre-fetching them.\n\nI considered changing \"fetch a module script tree\" to \"fetch a module script graph\" but am not sure. It's kind of still a tree in terms of how it's fetched.\n\n@jonco3 and @ajklein for review\n",
